  ⎿  · **[C6/22] Package Version Verification:** IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md specifies `riverpod 3.0.0` and other package versions. As of my knowledge cutoff (May 2025), Riverpod 3.0 was not yet stable     
     — the latest was 2.x. Since today is Feb 2026, it may have been released since then.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
     **My recommendation:** When initializing the Flutter project in Phase 1, I should:                                                                                                                  
     - Use `flutter pub add <package>` to get the **latest stable version** of each package rather than pinning to the exact versions in IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md                                          
     - If Riverpod 3.0 is available, use it. If not, use latest 2.x and adjust code patterns accordingly                                                                                                 
     - Document actual installed versions in pubspec.yaml                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
     Should I follow the exact versions in the plan, or use latest stable versions at the time of `flutter pub add`? → Latest stable versions (Recommended)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
